--- !u!114 &8562539769043811959
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3129960194719436932}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 87bc19297bc412141a8f22378e97006e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  introNarration: '

    Hello There!

    Welcome to RAT.

    A game of cat and
    mouse chase and the mischief of spreading all the nasty infections.



    Before
    we jump you in to the gameplay, let me explain you some basic mechanics.'
  hungerNarration: '

    This is your hunger. If you are are hungry for too long,
    you will starve to death.


    Higher the value, the more well-fed you are.

    Hunger
    depletes every in-game minute by a small value. If you skip the day, you will
    lose a chunk of hunger, potentially risking starvation.


    To keep youself
    well-fed, look for food sources highlighted in orange when you play the game.

'
  staminaNarration: '

    This is your stamina. You need this to sprint and climb.

    Remember!
    Being hungry means you will have less stamina overall. '
  mutationNarration: '

    These are your mutations. Greyed out ones are the ones
    you have not unlocked.


    You  start with the ''BITE'' and ''CLAW'' mutation
    for now. When the game is paused, you will be able to see the descriptions of
    each mutation.'
  endTutorialNarration: "\nThese are the basics. \nYou are now dropped in a random
    spot in this apartment. Seek food, seek havok, spread infections, the goal is
    to deteriorate the environment till the human and his pet cat dies.\n\nTry not
    to get caught, watch out for traps, and fear that cat."
  humanNarration: '

    Oh no! The human has seen you. The human will alert the
    cat now! Quick! Scramble away from this zone!'
  catNarration: "\nOh no no no. That wretched cat has seen you. Cat will chase you
    down, you cannot outrun it. \n\nThe only safe zone is behind the walls, so find
    a way to get back there!"
  tutorialStage: 0
